Gnome, Spriggan

![[GNOMESPR.gif]]

|  |  |
| --- | --- |
| **CLIMATE/TERRAIN:** | Any/Wilderness |
| **FREQUENCY:** | Very rare |
| **ORGANIZATION:** | Pack |
| **ACTIVITY CYCLE:** | Any |
| **DIET:** | Omnivore |
| **INTELLIGENCE:** | Average to exceptional (8-16) |
| **TREASURE:** | A |
| **ALIGNMENT:** | Chaotic evil |
| **NO. APPEARING:** | 3-12 |
| **ARMOR CLASS:** | 3 or 5 (10) |
| **MOVEMENT:** | 9 or 15 |
| **HIT DICE:** | 4 or 8+4 |
| **THAC0:** | 17 or 11 |
